[32m+[m[32m- **JJWT** 0.13.0 (`jjwt-api`, `jjwt-impl`, `jjwt-jackson`)[m
[32m+[m[32m- **JUnit 5** (JUnit Jupiter, via `spring-boot-starter-test`)[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Maven** 3.9.16 (via Maven Wrapper)[m
